    "spec": "Derive 'locality' from the city using this fixed city-to-region table: Sydney->NSW, Melbourne->VIC, Brisbane->QLD. Return the canonical region string, or 'UNKNOWN' when the city is not in the table.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nDerive 'locality' from the city using this fixed city-to-region table: Sydney->NSW, Melbourne->VIC, Brisbane->QLD. Return the canonical region string, or 'UNKNOWN' when the city is not in the table.\n"
